<p id="A1.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The template defines the reference computation through <span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Model</span>, supplies inputs through <span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">get_inputs()</span>, and provides model initialization arguments through <span id="A1.SS2.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">get_init_inputs()</span>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Schematic static shape-profile template.</span></p>
</div>
