<section id="A6.SS2.SSS2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsubsection">F.2.2 </span>LEKA Hierarchical Agent Prompts</h4>

<div id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.SS2.SSS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">LEKA decomposes optimization along the IR hierarchy and assigns each editable representation to a resident agent. Each agent explores the optimization space exposed by its representation and coordinates changes with adjacent layers through shared evaluation feedback. The hardware-sensing agent remains read-only and converts measurement evidence into layer-specific optimization directions. The following templates summarize the shared instructions and each role’s optimization scope.</p>
</div>
